20
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:00,450
Kaiba!

21
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:02,120
Seto! Wait up!

22
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,631
We don't need him weighing us down anyway.

23
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:10,200
With good ol' Hamos over here,
those hoodlums won't stand a chance.

24
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,697
Someone's back to their old self again.

25
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:13,700
About time.

26
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:15,440
It took me a while,

27
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:19,600
but I realize being bummed out about
Mai's not gonna bring her back.

28
