Okay, what are you guys up to over there?

32
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:35,500
My glasses!

33
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,120
I can't find my glasses!

34
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,000
Uh, they're right there.

35
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:41,140
Where you just threw them?

36
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:43,130
Ow!

37
