131
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,880
Keep it down, old man.

132
00:08:41,900 --> 00:08:42,730
Grandpa!

133
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:46,057
You should stay out of things
that don't concern you.

134
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,200
Come on, boy!

135
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:52,080
