160
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,697
I mean, the guy's just an archaeologist.

161
00:10:29,780 --> 00:10:32,437
But didn't you guys say he
made some big discovery?

162
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:34,540
Yeah, he found Atlantis.

163
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:39,780
Rebecca, I've got an idea. What?

164
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:41,360
Remember that stone?

165
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:43,484
The one I gave to your grandpa?

166
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,540
Yeah, I have it around
my neck, right here.

167
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,842
