168
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,261
Maybe that's what Darts
and his lackeys are after.

169
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:53,680
Then be careful.

170
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,580
Okay, so now what?

171
00:10:58,940 --> 00:11:01,999
Easy, let's find out where
this Darts guy hangs out.

172
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,877
We bust in and get Hawkins.

173
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,980
But how?

174
00:11:05,300 --> 00:11:07,737
I don't think they're
listed in the phone book.

175
00:11:07,820 --> 00:11:08,650
She's right.

176
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:14,080
Besides, he doesn't have what they want,
which means they'll probably come back.

177
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:15,130
Great.

178
00:11:15,213 --> 00:11:17,037
So we just sit on our butts and wait?

179
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,460
I still like my plan.

180
00:11:18,660 --> 00:11:20,920
If we're gonna stay here, I gotta eat.

181
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,597
I can't wait on an
empty stomach, you know.

182
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,510
Good idea.

183
00:11:24,593 --> 00:11:25,577
I'll whip something up.

184
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:27,601
I'm not eating anything you cook.

185
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:29,010
Don't worry.

186
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:32,319
They're gonna bring your
grandpa back soon, Rebecca.

187
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:35,990
Bam!

188
00:11:36,073 --> 00:11:36,960
Smells delicious.

189
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:41,200
Hey, Tristan, is the table set yet?

190
