Some french fries would be nice.

206
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:41,461
So what'd you want to talk about?

207
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:43,040
I'm just scared, Yugi.

208
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:45,220
This whole thing is so strange.

209
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:48,020
I know, but we'll find your gramps.

210
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:50,240
Mm-mm, there's more.

211
00:12:52,300 --> 00:12:53,160
What's this?

212
00:12:53,780 --> 00:12:56,697
The creeps who kidnapped my
grandfather left it behind.

213
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:58,260
It came with a note.

214
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:01,420
I'll be waiting for you in Death Valley.

215
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:06,028
You'll show up if you want to
see your friend again, Raphael.

216
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:07,590
Oh, no!

217
00:13:07,673 --> 00:13:09,280
How far away is Death Valley?

218
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:14,374
Well, if we use Duke's car, it shouldn't
take us more than an hour or so.

219
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:18,560
Sorry, Rebecca, but I
have to go alone. Why?

220
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,176
I've put you and your family
in enough danger already.

221
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,270
Uh-uh.

222
00:13:24,353 --> 00:13:25,260
Don't be silly, Yugi.

223
00:13:25,560 --> 00:13:27,560
None of this is your fault at all.

224
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:28,981
Thanks, Rebecca.

225
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:32,097
But it's me they want, and
you'll be much safer here.

226
00:13:32,180 --> 00:13:35,617
And please don't tell the other
guys where I'm about to go, okay?

227
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:36,530
But why?

228
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:39,016
I don't want them to follow me there.

229
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,110
Interesting.

230
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:51,020
