destroyed everything you've found.

244
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:40,940
So, you're no longer a threat to us.

245
00:14:51,060 --> 00:14:53,900
The time draws near, great Leviathan.

246
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:57,940
With every soul you receive,
your power grows. Soon,

247
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:03,580
