250
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,780
The system's down!

251
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:15,860
Quick, the light bulb!

252
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,960
Well, I know what I have to do.

253
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:49,000
Time to face these creeps.

254
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,540
Yu-Gi!

255
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:00,640
Don't worry, Rebecca. I'll be back.

256
00:16:11,940 --> 00:16:13,440
Ready, Copernicus?

257
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:47,240
