259
00:16:52,020 --> 00:16:55,780
Uh, um, uh, I promised I wouldn't tell.

260
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:59,839
Rebecca, how could you let
him just leave like that?

261
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:04,194
Take it easy, Joey, it's not her fault.

262
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,713
You guys would have done the same thing.

263
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:09,777
No, we would have talked
some sense into him, Taya.

264
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:10,960
I'm coming, Yook.

265
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,490
Oh, no.

266
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:16,140
Come on, get back here!

267
00:17:19,340 --> 00:17:21,580
Hey, man, what's wrong?

268
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,300
Professor Hawkins!

269
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:29,320
My grandpa!

270
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,120
Professor!

271
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:39,360
Rebecca, where is Yugi?

272
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:50,820
This guy must want to duel us, right? Yes.

273
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:54,577
As long as we have our Timaeus
card, we should be fine.

274
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:57,200
But he holds the seal of Orycalcos.

275
00:17:57,420 --> 00:17:59,637
Yeah, but we have something else over him.

276
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:02,000
A belief in the heart of the cards.

277
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,686
I'm glad you're back, Gramps.

278
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,880
All right, Paya.

279
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:12,981
We'll find Yugi.

280
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,593
You hold down the fort till we get back.

281
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:17,900
Okay, just be careful, guys.

282
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:19,338
We'll be back soon.

283
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:25,040
Keep an eye out for Rex and Weevil.

284
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,552
I don't trust those two.

285
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:32,480
We can't miss the showdown
between Yugi and those guys.

286
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:36,800
I have to find out how they made
Mayan to such a strong duelist.

287
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:39,380
Can't we take a quick snack break?

288
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,680
It's Yugi!

289
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,038
He's getting ahead!

290
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,550
No!

291
00:18:45,633 --> 00:18:47,088
Put the pedal to the metal!

292
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,660
Be careful, Yugi.

293
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:01,910
Please.

294
00:19:07,260 --> 00:19:08,500
Hang in there, Yugi.

295
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:09,760
We're on our way.

296
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:33,940
I'm ready for you, Pharaoh, thanks
to my deck and the power it holds.
